{"id":"4450994380fbceab","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-first-order-clause-validity.md","title":"一阶子句的全称模型语义","display":"df-first-order-clause-validity — 一阶子句的全称模型语义","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-first-order-clause-validity","aliases":["72-df-first-order-clause-validity"],"display":"df-first-order-clause-validity — 一阶子句的全称模型语义","depends_on":["[[72-df-first-order-clause]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61/PDF73; source universal-clause semantics","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-first-order-clause-validity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-first-order-clause-validity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-clause-validity — 一阶子句的全称模型语义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d1d3b024cc821344\" href=\"?note=d1d3b024cc821344\" title=\"72-df-first-order-clause\">72-df-first-order-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61/PDF73; source universal-clause semantics"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\\)</span> 满足本册 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in D^V\">\\(s\\in D^V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。文字满足使用经典 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A\">\\(\\overline A\\)</span> 在这里解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{cl}C:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists l\\in C\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models l).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{cl}C:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists l\\in C\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models l).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s\\in D^V\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{cl}C),\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}F:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in F\\ (\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s\\in D^V\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{cl}C),\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}F:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in F\\ (\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unsat}_{FO}(F):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\mathfrak M\\ (\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Unsat}_{FO}(F):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\mathfrak M\\ (\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>子句中的自由变量隐式全称量化：不同子句可以独立选取变量值。空子句在每个赋值都假；非空域保证至少一个赋值。量化全部结构是ZFC公式，未假定所有结构构成一个集合。这个全称语义是标准化分离与代入可靠性的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-clause","status":"resolved","id":"d1d3b024cc821344","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in D^V","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{cl}C:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists l\\in C\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models l).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s\\in D^V\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{cl}C),\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}F:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in F\\ (\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unsat}_{FO}(F):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\mathfrak M\\ (\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}F).","display":true}],"bytes":1843,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-nat